  "usageRules": [
    "Main actions use ink background with surface-colored labels.",
    "Text on accentSoft uses ink; secondary on accentSoft is below normal-text AA in all three schemes.",
    "accent, stickerLeaf and stickerFlower are decorative colors, not ordinary small-text colors.",
    "Required focus, selection and checkbox states use a clear ink boundary or glyph plus non-color semantics; decorative accent outlines alone are insufficient.",
    "For A, ink on accent is 2.84:1: use ink checks on accentSoft or surface instead of on accent fill.",
    "Maintain coordinated lightness and lighting across designed stickers without tinting every object the same hue.",
    "User photographs retain their own colors; do not force palette grading.",
    "First use is blank. Generated records, photos, tasks and dates are examples, not default user data."
